#
# PKGBUILD for black-magic-probe-utils
#
# Contributor: Uffe Jakobsen <_uffe_|_at_|_uffe_|_dot_|_org_>
# Maintainer: Uffe Jakobsen <_uffe_|_at_|_uffe_|_dot_|_org_>
